00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:03,230
Be one.

2
00:00:03,230 --> 00:00:08,650
Daniel, Simon and Millie are talking about making friends.

3
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:15,500
Listen to their conversation and tick the advice mentioned in their talk.

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:21,610
What do you think is the best way to make friends?

5
00:00:21,610 --> 00:00:28,280
I think one of the best ways to make friends is to join a club.

6
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,990
Yes, I agree.

7
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:37,850
When you join a club, you'll meet people with the same interests as you.

8
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:42,550
True, that way you'll have a lot to talk about.

9
00:00:42,550 --> 00:00:47,990
But you'll need to be brave to speak to other people at the club.

10
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:54,690
Yes, it's important to be friendly and to smile at people.

11
00:00:54,690 --> 00:01:00,620
Another good place to make friends is the school dining hall.

12
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:06,380
You can sit next to someone and start a cheerful chat with them.

13
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:12,820
Yes, or you can ask a friend to introduce you to someone else.

14
00:01:12,820 --> 00:01:24,610
That's a good idea, but it takes time to make friends, so don't give up if it doesn't happen quickly. That's true.
